    <h2>Dexter Commercial down? Call the branch closest to you.</h2>
    <p>Same-day commercial laundry service across Los Angeles, Orange, Ventura, Santa Barbara, San Bernardino, Riverside, and San Diego counties. $120 commercial diagnostic waived with repair.</p>
